<title>How to Make Bio-Enzymes</title>
</head>
<body styyle="font-family:  arial, sans-serif; background-color:light yellow; color: pink; margin:20px;">
<h1 styyle="text-align:center; color:dark pink;">🌿 How to Make Bio-Enzymes at Home</h1>
<hr style="border:1 px solid black;">
<div style="text-align:center;">
<img src="https://i.pinimg.com/originals/6f/6a/df/6f6adf214d7edb4e19e1f465443fc2ab.jpg" alt="Bio Enzyme Bottles" style="width:300px; border-radius:10 px; border: 2px solid blue;">
</div>
 <h2 style="color:#006400;">🧪 Ingredients Required:</h2>
  <ul style="background-color:#e6ffe6; padding:10px; border-radius:8px;">
  <li>1 part citrus fruit peels (orange, lemon, or pineapple)</li>
  <li>3 parts water</li>
   <li>1 part jaggery or brown sugar</li>
   <li>A clean plastic bottle with a tight lid</li>
    </ul>
     <h2 style="color:#006400;">⚙️ Instructions:</h2>
    <ol style="background-color:#f9fff0; padding:10px; border-radius:8px;">
        <li>Mix jaggery, fruit peels, and water in the bottle.</li>
        <li>Leave some space at the top for gas formation.</li>
        <li>Close the lid tightly and shake well.</li>
        <li>Keep the bottle in a cool, dark place for 3 months.</li>
        <li>Open the lid slightly every few days to release gas.</li>
        <li>After 3 months, strain the liquid — your bio-enzyme is ready!</li>
    </ol>
     <h2 style="color:#006400;">🌱 Advantages:</h2>
    <ul style="background-color:#e6ffe6; padding:10px; border-radius:8px;">
        <li>Eco-friendly and chemical-free cleaner</li>
        <li>Reduces kitchen waste</li>
        <li>Safe for plants and pets</li>
        <li>Can be used for cleaning floors, bathrooms, and fruits</li>
    </ul>
     <h2 style="color:#8b0000;">⚠️ Disadvantages:</h2>
    <ul style="background-color:#fff0f0; padding:10px; border-radius:8px;">
        <li>Requires long fermentation time (about 3 months)</li>
        <li>Needs regular gas release to avoid pressure build-up</li>
        <li>Strong smell during fermentation</li>
    </ul>
     <p style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold; color:#2e8b57;">
        🌎 Small steps toward a cleaner planet!
    </p>

</body>
